        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Not a bot and not Mirai/Gafgyt: a small static x86-64 tool implementing\nthe public Dirty COW technique (CVE-2016-5195), about 800 bytes of own code\nlinked with glibc. No network code, no C2. Sophos/ZoneAlarm \"Exp/165195-A\"\nmatches the identification. The Mirai/Gafgyt labels come from rule false\npositives (glibc strings and x86-64 function prologues).\n\nWrite-up, YARA rule and IOCs:\nhttps://github.com/cyberpascal1101/linux-malware-research/blob/main/dirtycow-tool/README.md"
      }
